# Version History Sheet

::summary
The doc version-history sheet, reached from the ⋯ menu: every save is a version; version rows carry the trailing-action Restore (never Restore-as-title text). Restore forks the restored version forward as the new current — history is never destroyed. The current row has no restore affordance; Surfy edits carry the fin glyph and the prompt excerpt.
::

